# systemd's rule restarts systemd-vconsole-setup whenever a console binds,
# which on the live ISO is fbcon taking over tty1 as the installer's getty
# starts; its loadkeys then races agetty's hangup and fails with EIO. The unit
# is masked on the live ISO (the configurator runs loadkeys for the layout the
# user picks), so this empty file stands in for the rule.
